      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GENESIS BALE (2) boasts a strong record this course with six wins and five minors from 18 tries. Scored by 2 lengths last time (23.54) in a Grade 5 over 410m at this track. Has the ability and should feature. DUNACH FIREBALL (6) had been in great form but missed the frame latest when seventh (22.86) in a Grade 5 at Ballarat. Generally fast to begin but always back from the wide draw last time. Solid record here at the distance winning nine races. Cannot be underestimated. PAW MANNY (3) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing fourth (35.27) in a Grade 5 at Sandown. Solid record here at this trip including three wins. One of the main contenders. FIREWORKS (1) is building a nice sequence of placings and will be in the mix again.",
